      "id": 9103,
      "name": "Snail Shell",
      "username": "Snail_Shell",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/s/eada6e/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2013-12-05T05:12:53.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Just to clarify, Haka's GP states that you play the card.&nbsp; Once played, you either have to discard two cards, or destroy GP.&nbsp; Now, correct me if I'm wrong, but if GP is destroyed, the damage-negating effect of the card goes with it, right?&nbsp; That said, if you're just going to destroy it, what would be the point in playing it in the first place?</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:39:48.387Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
