      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/platinumwarlock/{size}/1869_2.png",
      "created_at": "2013-12-05T05:24:52.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>You got it--once the card is gone, so is the effect. &nbsp;Think of the two discards as your \"cost\" for playing Ground Pound. &nbsp;If you don't pay the cost, you don't get the awesome effect.</p>",
