      "created_at": "2013-12-06T21:05:27.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"McBehrer\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/mcbehrer/48/1850_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> McBehrer:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Killing Set first is my FAVORITE way of beating the Ennead. Just throwing that out there.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Killing Set early is usually my biggest mistake when playing on advanced. At least it always feels that way. They always happen to crush me the exact turn after Set dies every. single. time.&nbsp;</p>",
