      "created_at": "2013-12-06T21:22:08.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>My thinking is that an Alive Set only has a chance to churn out extra villain card plays. And they all suck on advanced. Dead Set is 100% certain to churn out extra villain cards each turn.</p><p>Is he really more of a threat alive than dead given the context of Advanced mode?</p>",
