      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "[quote=\"Envisioner\"]\n\nMy first game against the Ennies, I was like &quot;Extra villain plays?&nbsp; SET MUST DIE!&nbsp; ...Aw crap.&quot;Of course if you can Mistbind or Take Down the Ennead first, killing Set is likely to be tons of fun.&nbsp; But both NM and Legs have a fair number of cards you might not want to get as free-plays.\n\n[/quote]\n\nThe cards that work best with a downed set in my opinion are in order: Reclaim from the Deep, Vernal Sonata and Don&#39;t dismiss anything. If tempest is the last hero and he can spend the rest of the game playing only reclaim from the deep and still set up the best card for all other heroes. Is it a boring repetitive play kinda, but hey you&#39;ll still get a surprise each turn when set plays your card.\n",
